Prerequisite: log in first and store the session cookie in $env:TEMP\expressbookreviews-user-one.cookies. This removes only that user's review.

Command (PowerShell):
curl.exe -i -X DELETE http://localhost:5000/customer/auth/review/1 -b "$env:TEMP\expressbookreviews-user-one.cookies" -c "$env:TEMP\expressbookreviews-user-one.cookies"

Output (HTTP 200):
{"message":"Review deleted successfully."}

Verification after deleting reviewer_one's review while reviewer_two's review exists:
{"reviewer_two":"Second user review"}
